# An eccentric cam and a roller follower: the cam's centre turns about a fixed shaft, and
# the roller stays tangent to it with its centre on a plumb guide.
point shaft at 0,0 fixed
circle cam r 30 at 8,6
line throw from shaft to cam.center length 10
construction line guide from 0,20 to 0,90 fixed
fix guide.end
circle roller r 8 at 0,43.2
on roller.center guide
tangent cam roller
